Description: |
  Documents the app-wide static service locator that wires together every other cell in this
  forest (jobmanager, database, recipients, billing, and the network client library) at
  startup, plus the Provider extension point through which each singleton is actually
  constructed. The sole root of the dependency graph — nothing else in this forest imports from
  it.
